sequenceDiagram
    actor Operator
    participant UI
    participant BLE
    participant Camera
    participant Capture
    participant DB as Local SQLite
    participant Files
    participant Sync as WorkManager

    Operator->>UI: Заполняет обязательную анкету
    UI->>BLE: Подключить и подготовить
    UI->>Camera: Открыть preview
    BLE-->>UI: ready
    Camera-->>UI: preview ready
    Operator->>UI: Начать запись
    UI->>DB: INSERT recording(starting)
    UI->>Capture: arm(sessionZeroNs)
    par Sensor
        Capture->>BLE: принимать уведомления
        BLE-->>Capture: fragment(receivedMonotonicNs)
        Capture->>Files: BLERAW2 + packets
    and Video
        Capture->>Camera: start MediaRecorder
        Camera-->>Capture: first frame timestamp
        Capture->>Files: video.mp4
    end
    Capture->>DB: recording + sync anchors
    Operator->>UI: Завершить запись
    UI->>Capture: stop once
    Capture->>BLE: stop/disconnect
    Capture->>Camera: stop/finalize
    Capture->>Files: close + fsync + hashes
    Capture->>DB: completed + artifacts
    Capture->>Sync: enqueue unique recording upload
